01:15:14,610 --> 01:15:16,345
They did a really great job.

1734
01:15:16,412 --> 01:15:18,381
The KAFAC duo was insane.

1735
01:15:18,447 --> 01:15:20,449
- He's so good.
- Hyunjae won.

1736
01:15:20,516 --> 01:15:21,717
Cho was incredible at the end.

1737
01:15:21,784 --> 01:15:23,652
I know. If it wasn't for that...

1738
01:15:23,719 --> 01:15:26,122
- Uh, Hyunjae was just...
- Yeah.

1739
01:15:26,188 --> 01:15:28,657
Looked like he figured out everything
once he cornered Jin.

1740
01:15:28,724 --> 01:15:29,859
From there he just went...

1741
01:15:29,925 --> 01:15:32,795
Yeah, there's no way
to beat an out-boxer that good.

1742
01:15:33,295 --> 01:15:35,531
They put on such an exhilarating fight.

1743
01:15:36,065 --> 01:15:37,299
They were great.

1744
01:15:37,366 --> 01:15:38,634
Nice!

1745
01:15:38,701 --> 01:15:40,536
- Great job.
- That's hot.

1746
01:15:41,270 --> 01:15:42,538
Come on, get in here.

1747
01:15:43,406 --> 01:15:44,607
He can't get in.

1748
01:15:44,673 --> 01:15:46,475
- Come on.
- Somebody, call him an ambulance.

1749
01:15:46,976 --> 01:15:48,644
He does look like he needs one.

1750
01:15:50,279 --> 01:15:52,481
I think Sungwoon needs to rest a bit more.

1751
01:15:54,150 --> 01:15:56,519
Both of them
look pretty much out of it.

1752
01:15:57,053 --> 01:15:59,488
Uh,
you guys left everything out there.

1753
01:15:59,989 --> 01:16:01,424
- It was cool.
- Stand tall!

1754
01:16:01,490 --> 01:16:03,859
<i>We will now announce
the result.</i>

1755
01:16:05,194 --> 01:16:06,896
The winners of this match are

1756
01:16:08,464 --> 01:16:11,233
Lee Chaehyun, Cho Hyunjae
from the red corner.

1757
01:16:11,300 --> 01:16:12,968
{\an8}They really did well.

1758
01:16:13,469 --> 01:16:14,637
{\an8}Way to go!

1759
01:16:14,703 --> 01:16:16,405
{\an8}- They were great.
- Yeah.

1760
01:16:16,472 --> 01:16:17,840
The KAFAC salutes you. Attention!

1761
01:16:18,641 --> 01:16:20,476
- Salute! Loyalty!
- Loyalty!

1762
01:16:20,543 --> 01:16:22,511
At ease!

1763
01:16:23,045 --> 01:16:24,213
How cool.

1764
01:16:25,014 --> 01:16:28,684
Park Sungwoon,
I hope you're feeling a bit better now.

1765
01:16:28,751 --> 01:16:31,620
You're a passionate young man
who gave it everything,

1766
01:16:31,687 --> 01:16:33,989
but sadly,
you've been eliminated from <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

1767
01:16:35,157 --> 01:16:38,227
I was hoping to flip the script,
but I guess I came up short.

1768
01:16:38,294 --> 01:16:40,629
The KAFAC boxers really live up to...

1769
01:16:40,696 --> 01:16:42,598
They live up to their name.
I learned a lot.

1770
01:16:42,665 --> 01:16:44,567
- What?
- Slow down.

1771
01:16:45,234 --> 01:16:47,136
You were great! Whoo!

1772
01:16:47,203 --> 01:16:49,405
- All right!
- Awesome fight!

1773
01:16:51,674 --> 01:16:53,008
- That was fun.
- Yeah.

1774
01:16:53,075 --> 01:16:55,411
- It went by in a flash.
- I know. This is fun.

1775
01:16:56,645 --> 01:16:58,080
We get to see this?

1776
01:16:58,147 --> 01:17:00,082
- Feels like the finals already.
- What a big match.

1777
01:17:00,149 --> 01:17:01,183
Box!

1778
01:17:01,250 --> 01:17:02,284
The best versus the best.

1779
01:17:02,351 --> 01:17:03,919
- If that lands, he's done.
- Insane.

1780
01:17:03,986 --> 01:17:05,754
They might break down the cage.

1781
01:17:07,256 --> 01:17:08,424
Look at that combo.

1782
01:17:09,658 --> 01:17:11,026
Here it comes.

1783
01:17:11,527 --> 01:17:12,962
Gotta keep going till you drop.

1784
01:17:13,028 --> 01:17:14,230
That's savage.

1785
01:17:14,296 --> 01:17:16,465
Whoo!

1786
01:17:16,532 --> 01:17:19,635
The reigning undisputed unified
light heavyweight champion!

1787
01:17:19,702 --> 01:17:21,570
- Seriously?
- Champ, come in!

1788
01:17:23,539 --> 01:17:26,442
- This is insane!
- My name is Dmitry Bivol.

1789
01:17:27,009 --> 01:17:29,512
When I heard about Korea
and the boxing show,

1790
01:17:29,578 --> 01:17:31,413
of course I didn't have any doubts.

1791
01:17:31,480 --> 01:17:33,082
I wanted to come.

1792
01:17:57,239 --> 01:17:59,241
Translated by Yoon Jung Song

